Should not "create monster" be called "gate monster"? Logically, create 
monster would be a much higher spell like "create familiar": turning 
mana into physical form. Since "create monster" is limited by the max # 
of generated monsters, I think "gate monster" would be more accurate.

I would also suggest "create familiar" should ask what type of monster 
to "create"; and use an amount of power relative to the power and size 
of the familiar created.


